  28:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Smm/Std/IfxSmmSysMode.h ****  * \defgroup IfxLld_SmmSysMode_Usage How to use the SMM system mode driver?
  29:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Smm/Std/IfxSmmSysMode.h ****  * \ingroup IfxLld_Smm
  30:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Smm/Std/IfxSmmSysMode.h ****  *
  31:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Smm/Std/IfxSmmSysMode.h ****  * SMM sys mode driver provides the functionality to move device to different modes which ensures t
  32:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Smm/Std/IfxSmmSysMode.h ****  * Processing units can be individually set into IDLE mode depending on application needs and wake 
  33:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Smm/Std/IfxSmmSysMode.h ****  *
  34:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Smm/Std/IfxSmmSysMode.h ****  * SMM driver supports moving the core to IDLE/RUN state and system to sleep state.
  35:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Smm/Std/IfxSmmSysMode.h ****  * To move the system to standby refer PMS driver.
  36:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Smm/Std/IfxSmmSysMode.h ****  *
  37:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Smm/Std/IfxSmmSysMode.h ****  * In the following sections it will be described, how to integrate the driver into the application
  38:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Smm/Std/IfxSmmSysMode.h ****  *
  39:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Smm/Std/IfxSmmSysMode.h ****  * \section IfxLld_SmmSysMode_Preparation Preparation
  40:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Smm/Std/IfxSmmSysMode.h ****  * \subsection IfxLld_SmmSysMode_Include Include Files
